SetConfig_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the operator
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is the operator
    ├── given the market does not exist
    │   └── it should revert
    └── given the market exists
        ├── when the settings are invalid
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when the settings are valid
            ├── it should replace every setting
            ├── it should keep the market id, the pause and the price exponent
            └── it should emit {ConfigUpdated}
